<article class="env-remark" id="0DXV">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DXV">Remark <span data-tag="0DXV">52.20.2</span>.</a> Let $(A, \mathfrak m)$ be a complete Noetherian normal local domain of dimension $\geq 4$ and let $f \in \mathfrak m$ be nonzero. Then assumptions (1), (2), (3), (5), and (6) of Lemma <a href="/tag/0DXU" data-tag="0DXU">52.20.1</a> are satisfied. Thus vectorbundles on the formal completion of $U$ along $U \cap V(f)$ can be algebraized. In Lemma <a href="/tag/0EJ9" data-tag="0EJ9">52.20.4</a> we will generalize this to more general coherent formal modules; please also compare with Remark <a href="/tag/0EJC" data-tag="0EJC">52.20.7</a>. </p>
</article>